{"seq":3,"slug":"tls-certificate-management","title":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/tls-certificate-management","wordCount":853,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"tls-终止与证书管理-网关的-https-安全基础\">TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>TLS 终止（TLS Termination）</strong></td>\n<td>网关解密 HTTPS 流量，后端服务接收 HTTP（卸载加解密计算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TLS 透传（TLS Passthrough）</strong></td>\n<td>网关不解密，将加密流量直接转发给后端（端到端加密）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>mTLS（双向 TLS）</strong></td>\n<td>客户端和服务端互相验证证书，适合服务间通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ACME（Automatic Certificate）</strong></td>\n<td>Let&#39;s Encrypt 等 CA 的自动证书颁发协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SNI（Server Name Indication）</strong></td>\n<td>TLS 握手中传递目标域名，让一个 IP 承载多个证书</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tls-终止的意义\">TLS 终止的意义</h2><p>网关作为 TLS 终止点，是绝大多数生产架构的标准做法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端 ←→ HTTPS（TLS 终止在网关）←→ HTTP（内网）←→ 后端服务&#10;  或&#10;客户端 ←→ HTTPS（TLS 终止在网关）←→ HTTPS（内网 mTLS）←→ 后端服务\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端 ←→ HTTPS（TLS 终止在网关）←→ HTTP（内网）←→ 后端服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>客户端 ←→ HTTPS（TLS 终止在网关）←→ HTTPS（内网 mTLS）←→ 后端服务</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>好处</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>后端服务无需管理证书，简化运维</li>\n<li>网关集中做证书轮换，一处更新全局生效</li>\n<li>内网延迟更低（省去 TLS 握手开销）</li>\n<li>网关可以检查解密后的 HTTP 内容（WAF、请求日志等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安全考虑</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内网传输变为 HTTP 明文（在零信任架构中存在风险）</li>\n<li>解决方案：内网启用 mTLS（网关→服务间的流量重新加密）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"证书管理\">证书管理</h2><h3 id=\"手动管理-vs-自动管理\">手动管理 vs 自动管理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动购买/上传</td>\n<td>每年一次到期提醒</td>\n<td>忘记续期导致生产故障</td>\n<td>极少见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Let&#39;s Encrypt + ACME</td>\n<td>自动 60 天续期</td>\n<td>需要 80/443 端口可达</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cert-manager（K8s）</td>\n<td>声明式管理，自动续期</td>\n<td>需要 K8s 环境</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云 ACM（AWS/GCP）</td>\n<td>与 LB 深度集成</td>\n<td>依赖云厂商</td>\n<td>云原生部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cert-manager-实践\">cert-manager 实践</h3><p>在 Kubernetes 中，cert-manager 是管理 TLS 证书的事实标准工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 1. 定义 Issuer（证书颁发者）&#10;apiVersion: cert-manager.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterIssuer&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: letsencrypt-prod&#10;spec:&#10;  acme:&#10;    server: https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory&#10;    email: ops@example.com&#10;    privateKeySecretRef:&#10;      name: letsencrypt-prod-key&#10;    solvers:&#10;      - http01:&#10;          ingress:&#10;            class: nginx # 使用 NGINX Ingress 做 ACME challenge&#10;&#10;---&#10;# 2. 申请 Certificate&#10;apiVersion: cert-manager.io/v1&#10;kind: Certificate&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-tls&#10;  namespace: default&#10;spec:&#10;  secretName: api-tls-secret # 证书存入这个 Secret&#10;  issuerRef:&#10;    name: letsencrypt-prod&#10;    kind: ClusterIssuer&#10;  dnsNames:&#10;    - api.example.com&#10;    - api-v2.example.com\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 定义 Issuer（证书颁发者）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cert-manager.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterIssuer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">letsencrypt-prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ops@example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    privateKeySecretRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">letsencrypt-prod-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    solvers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">http01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nginx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 使用 NGINX Ingress 做 ACME challenge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 申请 Certificate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cert-manager.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Certificate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-tls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  secretName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-tls-secret</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 证书存入这个 Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  issuerRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">letsencrypt-prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterIssuer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dnsNames</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-v2.example.com</span></span></code></pre></div><p>cert-manager 会自动续期（证书到期前 30 天开始续期流程），并将证书写入 Kubernetes Secret。</p>\n<h3 id=\"证书轮换-zero-downtime\">证书轮换（Zero-Downtime）</h3><p>证书轮换不能导致服务中断：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CM as cert-manager&#10;    participant GW as API Gateway&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;&#10;    CM-&gt;&gt;CM: 证书将在 30 天后到期,开始续期&#10;    CM-&gt;&gt;CM: 向 Let&#39;s Encrypt 申请新证书&#10;    CM-&gt;&gt;GW: 更新 Kubernetes Secret(新证书)&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 检测到 Secret 变化,热加载新证书&#10;    Note over GW,C: 新旧证书同时在内存中(双证书过渡)&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 旧证书到期,移除\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CM as cert-manager\n    participant GW as API Gateway\n    participant C as 客户端\n\n    CM-&gt;&gt;CM: 证书将在 30 天后到期,开始续期\n    CM-&gt;&gt;CM: 向 Let's Encrypt 申请新证书\n    CM-&gt;&gt;GW: 更新 Kubernetes Secret(新证书)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 检测到 Secret 变化,热加载新证书\n    Note over GW,C: 新旧证书同时在内存中(双证书过渡)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 旧证书到期,移除</pre><p>关键是网关支持<strong>热加载</strong>（不重启进程），NGINX/Envoy/APISIX 均支持通过信号或 API 触发证书重载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mtls-服务间双向认证\">mTLS：服务间双向认证</h2><p>mTLS 要求双方都出示证书，适用于零信任内网场景（服务间通信也要相互验证）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"正常 TLS（单向）:&#10;  客户端验证服务端证书（这个服务器是真的 api.example.com 吗？）&#10;&#10;mTLS（双向）:&#10;  + 服务端验证客户端证书（这个调用方是被授权的服务吗？）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>正常 TLS（单向）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  客户端验证服务端证书（这个服务器是真的 api.example.com 吗？）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mTLS（双向）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  + 服务端验证客户端证书（这个调用方是被授权的服务吗？）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"网关到后端服务的-mtls\">网关到后端服务的 mTLS</h3><p>网关对外做 TLS 终止，对内向后端服务发起 mTLS 连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kong 配置：向上游发起 mTLS&#10;services:&#10;  - name: payment-service&#10;    url: https://payment-svc.internal&#10;    tls_verify: true&#10;    tls_verify_depth: 2&#10;    ca_certificates:&#10;      - ca_id: &#39;internal-ca&#39; # 内部 CA 证书，验证服务端证书&#10;    client_certificate:&#10;      id: &#39;gateway-client-cert&#39; # 网关的客户端证书（用于 mTLS）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kong 配置：向上游发起 mTLS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://payment-svc.internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tls_verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tls_verify_depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ca_certificates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">ca_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'internal-ca'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 内部 CA 证书，验证服务端证书</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    client_certificate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gateway-client-cert'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 网关的客户端证书（用于 mTLS）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Kubernetes + Istio 环境中，mTLS 由 Sidecar（Envoy）自动处理，业务代码无感知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"https-重定向与-hsts\">HTTPS 重定向与 HSTS</h2><p>网关应强制将 HTTP 流量重定向到 HTTPS，并设置 HSTS 告知浏览器只走 HTTPS：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"# NGINX 配置&#10;server {&#10;    listen 80;&#10;    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;  # HTTP → HTTPS 301 重定向&#10;}&#10;&#10;server {&#10;    listen 443 ssl;&#10;    # 告知浏览器：在 max-age 秒内只走 HTTPS，包括子域名&#10;    add_header Strict-Transport-Security &quot;max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains&quot; always;&#10;    add_header X-Content-Type-Options nosniff;&#10;    add_header X-Frame-Options DENY;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># NGINX 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listen 80;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;  # HTTP → HTTPS 301 重定向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listen 443 ssl;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 告知浏览器：在 max-age 秒内只走 HTTPS，包括子域名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains\" always;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header X-Content-Type-Options nosniff;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    add_header X-Frame-Options DENY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见的-tls-配置错误\">常见的 TLS 配置错误</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支持 TLS 1.0/1.1</td>\n<td>已知漏洞（POODLE、BEAST）</td>\n<td>只允许 TLS 1.2/1.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱密码套件</td>\n<td>可被暴力破解</td>\n<td>只允许 AEAD 套件（AES-GCM、ChaCha20）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证书链不完整</td>\n<td>部分客户端拒绝连接</td>\n<td>上传完整证书链（叶证书 + 中间 CA）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未配置 OCSP Stapling</td>\n<td>TLS 握手慢</td>\n<td>启用 OCSP Stapling，缓存吊销状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 明文内网</td>\n<td>内网监听可读取数据</td>\n<td>内网启用 mTLS（Service Mesh）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>TLS 终止在网关集中处理，简化了后端证书管理。cert-manager 结合 Let&#39;s Encrypt 实现自动续期，热加载机制保证证书轮换零中断。mTLS 在零信任场景下为内网通信提供双向身份验证。生产配置必须关闭旧 TLS 版本（只用 1.2/1.3）、使用强密码套件、并启用 HSTS。安全配置完成后，第 3 章<a href=\"../resilience/rate-limiting-throttling\">限流与节流策略</a>讲解如何保护后端免受流量冲击。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","id":"tls-终止与证书管理-网关的-https-安全基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TLS 终止的意义","id":"tls-终止的意义"},{"level":2,"text":"证书管理","id":"证书管理"},{"level":3,"text":"手动管理 vs 自动管理","id":"手动管理-vs-自动管理"},{"level":3,"text":"cert-manager 实践","id":"cert-manager-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"证书轮换（Zero-Downtime）","id":"证书轮换-zero-downtime"},{"level":2,"text":"mTLS：服务间双向认证","id":"mtls-服务间双向认证"},{"level":3,"text":"网关到后端服务的 mTLS","id":"网关到后端服务的-mtls"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTPS 重定向与 HSTS","id":"https-重定向与-hsts"},{"level":2,"text":"常见的 TLS 配置错误","id":"常见的-tls-配置错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authorization-access-control"},"next":{"title":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/rate-limiting-throttling"}}